      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'There are four different ways to play Word Dawg.



    Game Of the Day
    - All players use the same special curated bag of 50 letters each day. Compare
    your scores with your friends or try to beat your previous score.



    Untimed
    Game - Use 50 random letters. Take as long as you want to play the game.



    Timed
    Game - See how many words you can make in 4 minutes with an unlimited amount
    of letters.



    Custom Game - Make your own game by setting the time or the
    number of letters from Settings.



'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
